OL,3,GNEWSANew cancer centre 'cosy and
OL,4,Acalming', says patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuncorn's new Clatterbridge Cancer
OL,7,FCentre will make "a massive difference"
OL,8,Fto people in the area, a patient has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FMichelle Shelley, who was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith bowel cancer last year, was one of
OL,13,Fthe first patients to use the
OL,14,FNightingale Building at Halton General
OL,15,FHospital.
OL,17,FThe new #1.4m centre, which replaces
OL,18,Fthe former CANtreat unit, will provide
OL,19,Fchemotherapy, immunotherapy and
OL,20,Fsupportive care to patients from
OL,21,FRuncorn, Widnes, Warrington and
OL,22,Fsurrounding areas.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
